-International Functions in Digital Markets" ], "type": "posted-content" }, { "DOI": "10.2139/ssrn.6364158", 
-"URL": "https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.6364158", "abstract": "<jats:p>Token design lacks a coherent discipline. 
-Projects assemble mechanisms from precedent, failures are attributed to market conditions rather than 
-predictable design flaws, and no established field integrates the economics, control theory, game theory, and 
-constitutional design that token systems require. We frame the resulting practice as systems engineering: 
-coordinating autonomous agents under uncertainty while distributing ownership to contributors without 
-centralized enforcement. What distinguishes protocols from historical private currency issuance is 
-programmable enforcement of issuance rules and reconfiguration of the capital-labor boundary that results when 
-verified contribution generates ownership.&amp;nbsp; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We develop MeshNet, a fictional but 
-empirically parameterized decentralized wireless protocol that specifies five integrated mechanisms: 
-productive staking, reputation-weighted governance, burn-mint value capture, conviction voting, and PID 
-(proportional-integral-derivative)-controlled adaptive emissions. Parameters are calibrated to Helium hardware 
-economics, Filecoin collateral ratios, and governance data from 12 DePIN and DeFi protocols. A 240-run 
-agent-based ensemble, supplemented by 566 sensitivity and adversarial runs, stress-tests these mechanisms over 
-five years under four macroeconomic scenarios.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The simulation yields three 
-principal findings. First, adaptive emission functions as insurance: the PID controller compresses worst-case 
-variance by 6× (coefficient of variation from 0.544 to 0.087 under competitor shock) while sustaining 8,880 
-nodes at the 5th percentile versus 1,049 under static policy. Second, this advantage is conditional: bull 
-markets produce identical outcomes, and the engineering premium emerges only under sustained contraction. 
-Third, without pre-planned guardrails the controller can trigger integral wind-up, reinforcing the case for 
-simulation-first design methodology. The methodology generalizes to any token economy that must coordinate 
-autonomous agents under uncertainty.</jats:p>", "author": [ { "affiliation": [], "family": "Zukowski", 
